[standards/infrastructure/iac/STD-INFRA-IAC-006-linting.md#example-2-versionstf-with-random-provider-declared]

#### Example 2: `versions.tf` with `random` Provider Declared

```hcl
# versions.tf — all providers declared to satisfy terraform_required_providers (REQ-IAC-006-05)

terraform {
  required_version = ">= 1.7.0"

  required_providers {
    aws = {
      source  = "hashicorp/aws"
      version = "~> 5.0"
    }
    random = {
      source  = "hashicorp/random"
      version = "~> 3.6"    # REQ-IAC-006-05b: random must be declared when used
    }
  }
}
```
